msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e69a6a7a91b807a6110034a7125be5d434560cc46228bd67b90409db43ed5e4
#. default-sha256: 5c2b1c81ebcb34db96616938b810b43ef0311156aa11b42641019232f1e4e974
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking down dejectedly at the undrunken tea, the White-Haired Girl walked alone down the "
"corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Guardando sconsolata il tè ormai raffreddato, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi si incamminò da "
"sola lontano dal corridoio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 085df09c6a4f8ae7df14bde21ee6c8f3b5d30f01c1c48df06d2a40df47e8525f
#. default-sha256: a5a900977e49bc5d900d11dfea5ae4c2cb3ad54dab82039468e04c52e7fb1dba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though its calming scent filled the air, there was nobody around to have their heart warmed "
"by it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene quel profumo avesse riempito l’aria, non c’era nessuno a cui potesse riscaldare il "
"cuore."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4a8a17a3a053156c32bda66e37ee2ea301d8c400df5c8b854f017b0f97b9f41
#. default-sha256: 20ac53f47c393059e4e21c751da4e8690708f0dc701d7b3222bd65cf4e2ae87d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor was there anyone to alleviate her loneliness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Né c’era qualcuno che potesse alleviare la solitudine della ragazza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1244af656053ef3b31fc1c77bd6e54180767f12cddb3c7084354258b45c9995
#. default-sha256: 4ad112c152c65614d71a362e142e99a846bc4984d7f59fc727f37b38b2ea341a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite being the master’s wife, the maids who crossed her path in the halls said nary a "
"word to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante fosse la moglie del padrone di casa, le domestiche che la incrociavano non le "
"dicevano una parola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a276dd232ac2a42f577922d5aec3fdb827b2884698374b8553ad6b59044cca3d
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1CC945B_1426_486D_A007_7D0E685D60C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e43754ffb58e388c2ef7664368dadba84b9cd729410edb1aa81c72efc88e96f0
